      "content": "it’s not just about being a \"perfect\" parent though. it’s more than that. it’s like... i feel like every day i'm just dragging them down with me. with the money issues and the stress and just my whole vibe... they’d be so much lighter without me to worry about. they'd actually be able to breathe.",
